# 261031-haiku-spawn-sites (read-only survey, claude CLI spawn sites)
branch: interactive-child-compare
scope: internal/harness non-test .go; grep for exec.Command/CommandContext and session flags

## sites
S1 core.go:154 NewSession (persistent child; Session struct core.go:121)
  argv: claude -p --input-format stream-json --output-format stream-json --verbose --include-partial-messages --model <o.Model; default "haiku" core.go:139>
        [--permission-prompt-tool stdio  unless o.NoPermission, core.go:147]
        [--resume <o.Resume>  core.go:150-152]
        [o.Extra...  core.go:153; from repl.go:252 --append-system-prompt <rule>, repl.go:255 --max-budget-usd <n>]
  bin: osenv.ResolveBin("claude") (LookPath, fallback name) core.go:154
  env: withCacheTTL(cleanEnv(CompactWindow), CacheTTL) core.go:155; dir: o.Cwd core.go:156; stderr nil (discarded) core.go:157
  stdin: StdinPipe core.go:158; stdout: StdoutPipe core.go:162; cmd.Start core.go:166 (not Run)
  stdin protocol: JSON lines. user msg {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":text}} (Send core.go:~231);
     permission reply control_response (RespondPermission core.go:~203); interrupt control_request subtype=interrupt (core.go:~222)
  stdout protocol: stream-json lines; reader goroutine -> s.lines chan (buf 256) until EOF, core.go:168-185; parseEvent = json.Unmarshal per line core.go:100
  session id: NOT passed by flag (no --session-id anywhere). Captured from incoming event field session_id -> setID (core.go:251-252 in Events, core.go:299-300 in idle reader). Resume via --resume only.
  lifetime: resident per Session; one child for many turns; Events() reads until type=result (timeout/intr/EOF exits);
     StartIdle reader consumes stdout between turns (pauseIdle/held). Close() core.go:355: StopIdle, close stdin, Wait up to 15s, then Kill.
  callers: repl.go:236 newSessionFn=NewSession (test seam); repl.go:238 start() builds opts (repl.go:239); start() called repl.go:765,805,990,1175; switchchild.go:217,228
     orchws.go:56 orchSwitch / orchws.go:69 orchFresh -> switchSession/routeChildren -> switchChild (switchchild.go:144)
  output parse: event map per line; type=="result" ends turn; stream_event/assistant usage read in touchMain (livechild.go:10-28)

