S5 tui.go:953 (outside brief targets, noted) exec.Command("claude","--version").Output() for /version. one-shot, no flags.

## livechild.go
  no exec call. Holds liveChild wrappers around *Session (livechild.go:122 c=&liveChild{Sess:r.sess,...}); repl.go:284 self liveChild{Sess:s}. Spawn happens only via S1.

## orch.go / orchws.go / repl.go
  orch.go: no spawn (mode parsing, orchRule, env). orchws.go: no exec; routes via orchSwitch/orchFresh -> S1. repl.go: no direct exec; spawn via start()->NewSession (S1).

## repo-wide check
  grep exec.Command|CommandContext in internal, cmd (non-test): exactly core.go:154, classifier.go:188, usagepoll.go:54, tui.go:703, tui.go:953. No --session-id usage.

## not found
  - no --session-id flag anywhere (session id only via --resume and event session_id).
  - no spawn in livechild.go, orch.go, orchws.go themselves.
